    "volunt_title": "Volunteer Program",
    "volunt_subtitle": "We always need helping hands",
    "volunt_intro": "Become a volunteer at Santa Dorotea and make a lasting difference in the lives of people with disabilities in Cajamarca, Peru!",
    "volunt_p1": "With us, you will master a new language fluently, experience a rich culture, new cuisine, and the Andean climate. Dive deep into Peruvian traditions and learn from our children to see the world with completely new eyes. You will grow with exciting challenges, forge unforgettable memories, and have great fun.",
    "volunt_tasks_title": "Your daily activities:",
    "volunt_tasks_desc": "You will support our children in daily routines such as meals, hygiene, and brushing teeth. You can share your talents by playing, studying, storytelling, crafting, or painting together. You will find that a warm smile, the twinkle in their eyes, or a genuine hug is the greatest reward for your work!",
    "volunt_privilege_quote": "You will return home with a completely transformed outlook on the world. A safe home and access to education are not guaranteed everywhere; you will learn to appreciate your privileges and cherish experiences that touch your heart forever.",
    "volunt_partner_notice": "Apply directly with us or via our sending partner organization: Welthaus Bielefeld.",
    "volunt_btn": "Apply as a Volunteer",
